[50.279006, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI'll first inspect the system, available toolchain, and any preexisting KLEE/STP artifacts.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -x; uname -a; cat /etc/os-release; whoami; pwd; ls -la; command -v clang-16; command -v llvm-config-16; clang-16 --version; llvm-config-16 --version; \r\ncommand -v klee || true; command -v stp || true; echo CPATH=$CPATH; echo PATH=$PATH\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
