[54.567735, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m2\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2KKLEE and STP are not installed. I'll check package availability and system dependencies before choosing between apt packages and a source build.\r\n\r\n```\r\napt-get update -qq && apt-cache policy klee stp libstp-dev minisat libminisat-dev z3 libz3-dev llvm-16-dev clang-16 lld-16 cmake ninja-build build-essential git\r\npython3 curl wget libgoogle-perftools-dev libgmp-dev libboost-all-dev 2>/dev/null | sed -n '1,240p'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
