[61.988951, "o", "\r\u001b[2KNo KLEE/STP packages are available in apt, so I'll build both from source. Next I'll install build dependencies and inspect available CPU/disk resources.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -eux; nproc; free -h; df -h / /app; dpkg -l | grep -E 'llvm-16|clang-16|cmake|ninja|bison|flex|gmp|boost|sqlite|zlib|libedit|ncurses' | awk '{print $2, $3}'\r\n| head -100; apt-cache search '^libstp|^stp ' | head\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
