[65.931597, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI'll install the required build tools and libraries, then fetch KLEE and STP sources.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -eux; export DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive; apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends git curl wget ca-certificates cmake ninja-build bison flex \r\nlibboost-all-dev libgmp-dev libgoogle-perftools-dev zlib1g-dev libsqlite3-dev libedit-dev libncurses-dev python3-minimal python3-setuptools pkg-config \r\nlibminisat-dev minisat unzip xz-utils file sudo vim less gdb >/tmp/apt-install.log 2>&1; tail -50 /tmp/apt-install.log; echo DONE\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
