[98.662204, "o", "\r\u001b[2KBuild dependencies are installed. I'll query KLEE tags and clone suitable sources; LLVM 16 support determines the version.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -x; cd /opt; git ls-remote --tags https://github.com/klee/klee.git | tail -30; echo '--- STP tags'; git ls-remote --tags https://github.com/stp/stp.git | \r\ntail -20\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
