[117.576103, "o", "\r\u001b[2KNow I'll configure and build STP 2.3.4 against the installed MiniSat, then install it and verify `stp` and `STPConfig.cmake`.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -eux; cd /opt/src/stp; rm -rf build; mkdir build; cd build; cmake -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr/local \r\n-DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/usr/local -DENABLE_TESTING=OFF -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON .. >/tmp/stp-cmake.log 2>&1; cmake --build . --parallel 20 >/tmp/stp-build.log 2>&1; \r\ncmake --install . >/tmp/stp-install.log 2>&1; ldconfig; echo '--- configure tail'; tail -60 /tmp/stp-cmake.log; echo '--- build tail'; tail -30 \r\n/tmp/stp-build.log; echo '--- install tail'; tail -40 /tmp/stp-install.log; echo '--- verify'; command -v stp; stp --version; find /usr/local -iname \r\n'*STP*Config*.cmake' -o -iname 'libstp*' | sort\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[117.576635, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
