[130.370618, "o", "\r\u001b[2KSTP is installed and functional. Now I'll inspect KLEE's build options and configure it against LLVM 16 with STP enabled and uClibc disabled.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -x; grep -n -i 'uclibc\\|ENABLE_SOLVER_STP\\|ENABLE_Z3\\|ENABLE_METASMT\\|RTTI\\|ENABLE_EH\\|LLVM_CONFIG' /opt/src/klee/CMakeLists.txt | head -120; echo '--- \r\noptions files'; grep -Rni 'ENABLE_KLEE_UCLIBC\\|UCLIBC' /opt/src/klee/cmake /opt/src/klee/CMakeLists.txt | head -80; echo '--- readme build'; grep -n -i -A8 -B4 \r\n'cmake.*ENABLE_SOLVER_STP\\|ENABLE_KLEE_UCLIBC\\|LLVM_CONFIG' /opt/src/klee/README.md | head -200; echo '--- llvm config'; llvm-config-16 --cmakedir; \r\nllvm-config-16 --has-rtti; llvm-config-16 --assertion-mode; ls /usr/lib/llvm-16/lib/cmake/llvm/LLVMConfig.cmake; command -v clang++-16; command -v llvm-link-16;\r\ncommand -v llvm-ar-16\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
