[138.7128, "o", "\r\u001b[2KKLEE configured successfully with STP 2.3.3, LLVM 16, and POSIX/uClibc runtime support disabled. I'll now compile and install KLEE.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -eux; cd /opt/src/klee/build; cmake --build . --parallel 20 >/tmp/klee-build.log 2>&1; cmake --install . >/tmp/klee-install.log 2>&1; ldconfig; echo '--- \r\nbuild tail'; tail -80 /tmp/klee-build.log; echo '--- install tail'; tail -100 /tmp/klee-install.log; echo '--- files'; command -v klee || true; ls -la \r\n/usr/local/bin/klee* 2>/dev/null || true; find /usr/local -maxdepth 4 -type d -name klee -o -name 'klee.h' | sort\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
