[206.697454, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m21\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[206.698344, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI'll perform a final validation of the installed linkage and environment, ensuring KLEE resolves from `PATH`, links STP, exposes its header via `CPATH`, and has\r\nno uClibc runtime installed.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -eux; bash -c '\r\n  source ~/.bashrc\r\n  test -x \"$(command -v klee)\"\r\n  test -f /usr/local/include/klee/klee.h\r\n  echo \"$CPATH\" | tr \":\" \"\\n\" | grep -Fx \"/usr/local/include\"\r\n  ldd \"$(command -v klee)\" | grep -E \"libstp|libminisat\"\r\n  test ! -e /usr/local/lib/klee/runtime/klee-uclibc.bca\r\n  rm -rf /tmp/final-klee-out\r\n  printf \"#include <klee/klee.h>\\nint main(void) { int x; klee_make_symbolic(&x, sizeof(x), \\\"x\\\"); return x == 0 ? 0 : 1; }\\n\" >/tmp/final_test.c\r\n  clang-16 -emit-llvm -c -g -O0 -Xclang -disable-O0-optnone /tmp/final_test.c -o /tmp/final_test.bc\r\n  klee --solver-backend=stp --output-dir=/tmp/final-klee-out /tmp/final_test.bc >/tmp/final-klee-stdout.txt 2>&1\r\n  grep -E \"Using STP solver backend|SAT solver: MiniSat|generated tests\" /tmp/final-klee-out/messages.txt\r\n  echo FINAL_VALIDATION_OK\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[206.698746, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[206.806339, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[206.806707, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n+ bash -c \r\n  source ~/.bashrc\r\n  test -x \"$(command -v klee)\"\r\n  test -f /usr/local/include/klee/klee.h\r\n  echo \"$CPATH\" | tr \":\" \"\\n\" | grep -Fx \"/usr/local/include\"\r\n  ldd \"$(command -v klee)\" | grep -E \"libstp|libminisat\"\r\n  test ! -e /usr/local/lib/klee/runtime/klee-uclibc.bca\r\n  rm -rf /tmp/final-klee-out\r\n  printf \"#include <klee/klee.h>\\nint main(void) { int x; klee_make_symbolic(&x, sizeof(x), \\\"x\\\"); return x == 0 ? 0 : 1; }\\n\" >/tmp/final_test.c\r\n  clang-16 -emit-llvm -c -g -O0 -Xclang -disable-O0-optnone /tmp/final_test.c -o /tmp/final_test.bc\r\n  klee --solver-backend=stp --output-dir=/tmp/final-klee-out /tmp/final_test.bc >/tmp/final-klee-stdout.txt 2>&1\r\n  grep -E \"Using STP solver backend|SAT solver: MiniSat|generated tests\" /tmp/final-klee-out/messages.txt\r\n  echo FINAL_VALIDATION_OK\r\n\r\n/usr/local/include\r\n        libstp.so.2.3 => /usr/local/lib/libstp.so.2.3 (0x0000f85a93580000)\r\n        libminisat.so.2 => /usr/local/lib/libminisat.so.2 (0x0000f85a8ba00000)\r\nKLEE: Using STP solver backend\r\nKLEE: SAT solver: MiniSat\r\nFINAL_VALIDATION_OK\r\n\r\n"]
