[209.770285, "o", "\r\u001b[2KKLEE 3.3 is installed successfully with:\r\n- LLVM 16 / clang-16\r\n- STP 2.3.3 using MiniSat\r\n- uClibc disabled\r\n- `klee` available on `PATH`\r\n- KLEE headers available through `CPATH`\r\n- Environment variables configured at the top of `~/.bashrc` so they load even in non-interactive shells\r\n\r\nFinal end-to-end validation passed.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
